      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cfb491476b5b77800e860ec|full_name} Not a bad idea, but honestly even normal demanding avatars tend to be more demanding than any difference some resolution scaling will make. Let alone ones that cause major stuttering or even crashing all on their own.",
